= Filling

Mash @potatoes#6 with @butter#4 tbsp and @grave milk#1/2 cup. Season.

Brown @minced lamb#1 lb in the pan. Add @onion#1 and @carrots#2, diced.

> The lamb must be well and truly dead. Brown until it stays down.

= Assembly

Layer the filling in the dish. Cover with the mash. Fork the surface like a headstone.

Bake at ~375 F# for ~40 minutes#. Rest for ~5 minutes# before serving.